WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.170
-The president and his allies
have decided

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.039
on a closing message for the
final days of the campaign.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:08.575
Whine about social media and
pretend the pandemic is over.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.710
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.814
♪♪

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:17.050
There's a lot you can say
about Donald Trump's

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.086
inner circle and the leadership
of the modern Republican Party,

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.688
but when you boil it down, it's
basically just a collection

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:25.024
of gigantic weirdos.

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:27.393
They're the people who
collect ceramic pigs

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.062
and sit by their windows,
writing down

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:30.863
license plate numbers
for no reason.

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.098
Take, for example, house
minority leader Kevin McCarthy,

00:00:33.098 --> 00:00:36.102
who showed up to one of Trump's
rallies yesterday and claimed

00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:38.371
Republicans are going to
take back the House.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.906
McCarthy then belched up this,
I think,

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:43.942
English sentence about
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi.

00:00:43.942 --> 00:00:46.813
-I want you to watch Nancy
Pelosi hand me that gavel.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:50.349
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:55.688
And I promise you this,
I won't bang her with it,

00:00:55.688 --> 00:01:00.059
but I'll bang the end to the
socialism and, yes, to America.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.660
-What now?

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:05.331
"I'll bang the end to the
socialism and yes to America"?

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.933
That sounds like a poorly
translated leaflet

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.102
dropped on Moscow during
the Cold War.

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.905
Why do all these guys talk like

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:15.174
rip-off dollar store action
figures made in Eastern Europe

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:17.243
that your grandma would get you
for Christmas?

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:21.080
Oh, wow, it's a Fuzz Goodyear?

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.916
Let me pull the string.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.485
-Infinity is where I'm going

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:29.355
and maybe even a little bit
further!

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:32.191
-The leaders of the modern GOP
are basically just

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:37.230
a bunch of goofy old puds.
Yeah, I said it, puds.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.865
The type of guy who's still
working at

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:41.233
your hometown bowling alley
30 years after high school

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:43.102
because he gets
free disco fries.

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:47.473
"Plus I get all the shoe spray I
can huff, and that is a lot."

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:50.309
For example, Republicans held a
hearing on big tech companies

00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:53.712
yesterday just to complain about
supposed social media bias

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:56.248
against conservatives,
which it's not a thing.

00:01:56.248 --> 00:01:58.451
Now, there are progressives,
like Elizabeth Warren

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.119
and tonight's guest,
Bernie sanders,

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:02.588
who really do want to break up
big tech monopolies

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.290
that have consolidated
too much power.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.058
But Republicans just
want to whine

00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:08.194
about mean tweets they
don't like.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.461
The best example of that

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:11.597
came from Wisconsin Senator
Ron Johnson,

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:15.001
when he complained about an
obviously satirical tweet.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.870
-Mr. Dorsey, you talked
about your policies

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:21.808
toward misinformation and that
you will block misinformation

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:24.877
if it's against civic integrity,

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:27.813
election interference
or voter suppression.

00:02:27.813 --> 00:02:31.550
Let me give you a tweet that
was put up on Twitter.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.753
It says, "Senator Ron Johnson
is my neighbor

00:02:34.753 --> 00:02:37.690
and strangled our dog, Buttons,
right in front of

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:40.626
my 4-year-old son and
3-year-old daughter.

00:02:40.626 --> 00:02:43.129
The police refuse to
investigate.

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:47.233
This is a complete lie,
but important to retweet

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.902
and note that there are more
of my lies to come."

00:02:49.902 --> 00:02:53.139
How could that not be a
violation of voter suppression?

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:56.809
Obviously, if people think I'm
strangling my neighbor's dog,

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.945
they may not show up
at the polls.

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:00.680
That would be voter suppression.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.583
-"And another thing, Mr. Dorsey,
last night, my door bell rang

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:05.485
late at night.
So I went to answer it,

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:08.020
and when went to answer it,
there was a flaming bag of poo

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.356
on my front step so I tried to
stamp out the fire,

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:12.358
but I got poo all over my shoes.

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:14.260
This is clearly an act
of voter suppression

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.629
by the neighborhood teens.
Because if I have poo-poo

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:19.698
on my shoes, I'll be too
embarrassed to go vote!"

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:22.802
The bigger problem here is Ron
Johnson thinks his constituents

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:26.272
might actually believe that he
strangled his neighbor's dog

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:31.911
and, yeah, okay.
I can kind of see it.

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:38.017
With that said, Jack Dorsey
looks like a dog serial killer.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:41.721
Like straight up a guy who
took out multiple dogs.

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.989
In Ron Johnson's
corn chowder brain,

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:46.392
a joke tweet about a senator
is voter suppression,

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:48.394
but invalidating mail-in ballots

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:50.329
and making people wait
hours to vote isn't.

00:03:50.329 --> 00:03:53.199
He's like a guy who parks his
BMW in a fire lane,

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.168
then loses his [bleep]
when his car gets towed.

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:56.402
"This is voter suppression!

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.537
How am I supposed to get
to the polling place now?"

00:03:58.537 --> 00:04:01.173
And then there was Tennessee
Senator Marsha blackburn,

00:04:01.173 --> 00:04:05.244
who asked the CEO of Google if
the company was still employing

00:04:05.244 --> 00:04:06.612
someone who criticized her.

00:04:06.612 --> 00:04:09.916
-Is Blake Lemoine,
one of your engineers,

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:12.384
still working with you?

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:16.322
-Uh, Senator, I'm familiar
with his name as a name.

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:19.459
I'm not sure that he's currently
an employee.

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:20.959
-Okay.

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:24.997
Well, he has had very unkind
things to say about me,

00:04:24.997 --> 00:04:27.400
and I was just wondering
if you all

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.469
had still kept him
working there.

00:04:30.469 --> 00:04:31.904
-Man, Fox News was right.

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.706
Cancel culture
is out of control.

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:35.908
She sounds like she's
asking to speak the manager

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:37.743
about a sales assistant
at Costco.

00:04:37.743 --> 00:04:40.113
"Is Madison still working here?

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:42.949
She had very unkind things to
say about me when I tried to

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:45.117
sample the pizza rolls
in the frozen aisle.

00:04:45.117 --> 00:04:46.719
Very hurtful things

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:48.855
about how I'm not supposed
to open the box."

00:04:48.855 --> 00:04:51.457
This is the fundament reality
of the modern GOP.

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:53.559
They're all Donald Trump.
He complains about social media,

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:55.895
so they complain about social
media, even though most of them

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:58.030
