bulletin board.

00:05:00.032 --> 00:05:02.702
"Coffee table for sale.
What the hell does OBO mean?

00:05:02.702 --> 00:05:04.270
This is unfair!"

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.071
This is what the GOP is now.

00:05:06.071 --> 00:05:08.441
They've failed at everything
else, so they're reduced to

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:10.743
