00:05:33.131 --> 00:05:36.602
You can, too, on yours.
They are censoring us.

00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:38.171
They don't do it to
the other side.

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:40.906
It's gross but Americans
are seeing through it.

00:05:40.906 --> 00:05:42.674
Believe me, Americans
