00:06:17.844 --> 00:06:19.479
Joe Biden has a large
national lead.

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:21.747
Much easier path to
270 than Trump.

00:06:21.747 --> 00:06:24.283
Two national polls yesterday
showed Biden up by 12

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:25.551
and 11 points each.

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:27.386
Which, somehow, gives me
even more anxiety

00:06:27.386 --> 00:06:28.888
