00:06:33.992 --> 00:06:37.029
You're like, "Okay, so
what are you gonna do?"

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:40.733
"Oh, nothing."
"You won't be like lonely?"

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:44.203
"Oh, no, I'll be fine."

00:06:44.203 --> 00:06:47.206
"Well then I'm not going!"

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:48.974
And we have to remember
