You can't see the food
on the plate.

00:11:11.036 --> 00:11:13.539
That's why they put a picture of
what you're eating on the bib."

00:11:13.539 --> 00:11:17.443
Also why is he narrating the
thought process of a germ?

00:11:17.443 --> 00:11:19.945
He sounds like a doctor
giving a Ted Talk

00:11:19.945 --> 00:11:21.446
after a massive head wound.

00:11:21.446 --> 00:11:24.083
"The germs look at you and say,
'I'm going right in

00:11:24.083 --> 00:11:27.085
with the food,' and then they
hitch a ride on the Big Mac,

00:11:27.085 --> 00:11:30.155
or Whopper, either one, and
slide down your throat

00:11:30.155 --> 00:11:32.724
into your stomach, where
they pretend to be normal cells

00:11:32.724 --> 00:11:36.461
to blend in, and then
when no one's looking,

00:11:36.461 --> 00:11:39.298
they sneak down,
down to your butt,

00:11:39.298 --> 00:11:42.435
and that's where
the farts come from.

00:11:42.435 --> 00:11:45.371
We love the farts, don't we?

00:11:45.371 --> 00:11:50.342
Oh, they make us laugh
with their silly sounds.

00:11:50.342 --> 00:11:55.714
Silly sounds.
Not crooked Joe.

00:11:55.714 --> 00:11:57.549
Doesn't love the farts."

00:11:57.549 --> 00:11:59.485
There are less than five days
left in the campaign,

00:11:59.485 --> 00:12:02.420
